# Transient tools/cc_* scratch (consistent with root /cc_*): cc_*.py / cc_*.json /
# cc_*.err / dumps. Load-bearing harnesses already tracked (cc_layer3_*) are
# unaffected — gitignore does not untrack committed files.
tools/cc_*

# Build/shell-redirect accidents that got committed once (Stage 0.4). No script
# regenerates them; these globs are insurance so a recurrence stays untracked.
# (The actual filenames contain U+F03A, the NTFS-safe substitute for ':'.)
*tmpbuild_out.txt
*ExecutionPolicy RemoteSigned*

# Research-paper library binaries: git home is the private repo
# (slimvince/research-papers), never this public fork.
docs/research_papers/*.pdf
tools/BCMH_dataset/
